   "@type": [
    "cg:type/Evidence",
    "Evidence"
   ],
   "title": "The expected-value effect on choice did not interact with condition in either study (p > 0.52).",
   "description": {
    "@type": "Item",
    "format": "text/plain",
    "content": "How much the lottery's value swayed choices was the same whether choosing for one or for two. — Anchor: “There was no significant interaction between the difference in expected values and experimental conditions in either study (p > 0.52)”"
   },
